dia#tipu-sultan">Tipu Sultan</a> cedes half his territory in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#treaty-of-seringapatam">Treaty of Seringapatam</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1799</span><span class="rf-text">British forces storm <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#srirangapatna">Srirangapatna</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia#tipu-sultan">Tipu Sultan</a> is killed</span></li></ol>
